Deviation:
- Added pane.get pre-check before events.subscribe wait loop. Live herdr only
  emits immediate agent_status on subscribe when agent_status filter matches;
  without filter, already-idle/done panes never receive an initial event and
  would false-timeout. Pre-check preserves GATE ZERO happy path in <5s.
